    26	
    27	A lease is that pattern with a different predicate. Renewals are its trace
    28	half — evidence emitted by the running party, proposing nothing. The
    29	negotiation is its patch half. And the granted **duration is the guard** — the
    30	predicate *a renewal was observed within the duration* must keep holding, is
    31	checked only at the grantor's judgment points, and its failure is recorded as a
