    33	
    34	Stated once, because it is the whole shape: **a lease is a bounded deviation
    35	from a safe default, actively maintained by evidence, reverting on evidence
    36	failure, with the revert recorded as a fact and performed by the owner at
    37	points it already passes through.** A patch deviates from unoptimized
    38	execution; a lease deviates from nothing-held.
