    40	The mapping is not clean, and the divergences are where this document does its
    41	work. Two of them are structural, and the other three follow from the first.
    42	
    43	**The guard's subject is not the applier.** In the precedent one party is both:
    44	the VM emits the trace and applies the patches, so its guard predicates over
    45	values present in its own hand at its own safe point. Here the holder emits the
    46	evidence and the grantor applies the judgment, and the guard's subject is
    47	remote with its evidence crossing a medium. From this follow two of the three
