   152	proposal is something someone said, not something the system holds.
   153	
   154	Three consequences follow, and each closes a question the vocabulary would
   155	otherwise leave open. A grantor **owes no answer** to a proposal; silence is
   156	its own sufficient response. `:dao.lease/rejected` is therefore courtesy in
   157	exactly the way `:dao.lease/released` is — it buys the holder a definitive
   158	negative it was never owed, and a system in which no refusal is ever appended
   159	is fully correct. And a holder's wait on an unanswered proposal is bounded by
